              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashaija boona ab'omu ruembo rwabo baryamuteera amabaare, afe. Ku muritwaza mutyo, muryaiha ekyo kibi omuriimwe; Abaisraeli boona baryakihurira, batiine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.21",
